Package: nimbus-catalog
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: nimbus-control
Description: Nimbus Control Center app catalog
 The apps the Nimbus Control Center offers for one-click installation:
 for each app, a manifest (with its own template_version), a Docker
 Compose template and an icon, in /usr/share/nimbus-control/catalog/.
 .
 Updating this package never changes installed apps. When an app's
 template_version is newer than the one an installed app was created
 from, the Control Center shows "Template update available" for it.
